    "%@ · 还没有模式" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ · No mode yet"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@・モードなし"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 已经在打哈欠了。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ is already yawning."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HAKU 会留在家里，他的罐子和东西都在。KURO 用她自己的罐子，第一次从零开始。随时可以换回来。" : {
      "comment" : "设置：换角色前的确认",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HAKU stays home with his cans and things. KURO uses her own cans, starting from zero the first time. You can switch back anytime."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HAKUは家に残ります。缶も持ち物もそのまま。KUROは自分の缶を使い、最初はゼロから。いつでも戻せます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KURO 会留在家里，她的罐子和东西都在。HAKU 用他自己的罐子，第一次从零开始。随时可以换回来。" : {
      "comment" : "设置：换角色前的确认",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KURO stays home with her cans and things. HAKU uses his own cans, starting from zero the first time. You can switch back anytime."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KUROは家に残ります。缶も持ち物もそのまま。HAKUは自分の缶を使い、最初はゼロから。いつでも戻せます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screen Time 监测没停：%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
