    "……随便看看，不急。" : {
      "comment" : "第二个预设角色",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "…just looking. no rush."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「健身」从下班里拿出来，放进这张卡了。一件事只放一张卡。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Gym” moved from Chill to this card. Each thing lives on one card only."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一天最多找你一次。早上不吵你。" : {
      "comment" : "onboarding",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once a day, max. No noise in the mornings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一天最多跟你说一次话，早上不打扰。" : {
      "comment" : "onboarding，正常大小写",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I'll talk to you once a day at most. Never in the mornings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上一步" : {
