    },
    "人在哪儿就点哪儿。没有地图，位置只存在这台手机上。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap a place while you're there. No map. Locations stay on this phone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "人生收藏" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Life collection"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "人站在这个地点时点「设为当前位置」。范围是进出算到达和离开的距离。只存在这台 iPhone 上。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stand at the place and tap “Use current location.” The radius is how far counts as arriving and leaving. Stays on this iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今天没有睡眠数据" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No sleep data today"
